[[Hespori]] can be periodically killed in the [[Farming Guild]], grown from a [[hespori seed]]. 

Typically, a melee slash weapon is used to kill Hespori.

==Requirements==
*Level {{SCP|Farming|65}}
* One [[hespori seed]] for each kill

== Suggested skills ==
* {{SCP|Attack|60}}+
* {{SCP|Strength|60}}+
* {{SCP|Hitpoints|60}}+

==Mechanics==
The Hespori is benign until the player attempts to harvest it. You can enter the cave, drink potions and enable prayers before starting the fight.

The Hespori is surrounded by four [[Flower|flower buds]] that keep it invulnerable while it attacks the player. These buds open three times during the fight, on initiation of the fight and again when the Hespori has 66% and 33% health remaining. Each bud has 10 hitpoints but will die in one hit from any weapon.

The Hespori has a ranged attack, a magic attack, and a special attack:

'''Ranged Attack''':

Throws green spores that hit twice with a max hit of 8+8 (reduced to 2+2 with [[Protect from Missiles]]'')''.

'''Magic Attack:''' 

A green wave with a max hit of 14 (reduced to 3 with [[Protect from Magic]]).

'''Special Attack''': 

{{mes|color=red|Hespori entangles you in some vines!}} will appear in the chatbox when the Hespori uses this special attack, with roots immobilizing the player preventing movement and attacks. After 6 seconds (10 ticks) the player will take 40+ damage unless they break free early by clicking repeatedly on either a new tile or the Hespori. As you click, {{mes|You feel the vines loosen slightly as you try to move.}} will appear in the chatbox. After this message appears for the 5th time, clicking once more will prevent the special attack and allow the player to move and attack again.

