With high combat stats and good equipment, little to no food or prayer restore will be needed when fighting hespori.

[[Blisterwood stake]] is an easily renewable "free" dart that has long range, allowing the player to stand still during the fight.

With the [[Rite of vile transference|rite of vile transference]] unlocked, the upgraded [[Death charge|Death Charge]] can be used on the second set of flowers, along with a dose of [[Surge potion|surge potion]] at 81 [[Herblore]], for a total of 155 [[Special attacks|special attack]] energy.

